{"v":4,"catch":"在街頭釋放終極甩尾傳奇。","desc":"踏入重新製作的日本汽車文化世界，重溫80年代末至90年代的熱血氛圍！本版本為速度、甩尾和激烈賽車的愛好者提供了全面升級的體驗。\n\n享受：\n\t•\t升級的畫面和性能，帶來真實街頭賽車的感覺。\n\t•\t壯觀的甩尾和刺激的直線加速賽，每一秒都至關重要。\n\t•\t每輛車超過100個改裝零件，讓你完全按照自己的喜好打造和定制愛車。\n\t•\t數十個挑戰性關卡和賽道，每一個都旨在將你的甩尾技巧推向極限。\n\nHashiriya Drifter-Car Racing,Drift,Drag REMASTER 是真正日本汽車文化迷、甩尾愛好者及高強度街頭賽車狂熱者的終極遊戲。燒胎、稱霸街頭，成為甩尾傳奇！","publisher":"Console Lab Games","release":"2025-11-06","genres":["競速","模擬","街機","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/baadc6338431a05d62ceae4753e27204d71beee210eb4faa5bb8fc01073d0a5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/948f9ee714a7c6356076ff71889952fb7ef6f6b42e2715bdc9f376395f49624d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/257c5b0a8eefc1f735c5c49c6a37f2e9ca70098f07088fa31e9e513b57d5348c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/98c04976adddb7668ec013e8c94429ad684a79e8ebcec275fa8c993cd2cc47ab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9e615e4dc007ce125f620b58bd62e217cc4da42b517a355ddb81578af109445.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b8c2169387f89d0616bc9d56c7b45675e28fc8d272b8d24ca570f4814edfacb.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a1002408c000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000071885","name":"Hashiriya Drifter-Car Racing,Drift,Drag REMASTER: Extra Funds","img":"61eef9c6343b15658593baadab1dfadd5d4aec7d4b34330fad52ba93f2ccb651","date":"2026-04-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000082244","name":"Hashiriya Drifter-Car Racing,Drift,Drag REMASTER: Road Success","img":"76d23faf81e1d0c769aa365f639398e53c3a585f9189329e2c50e4034ee27fea","date":"2026-10-15","mem":false}]}